+Added `Hecton8.Core.UnsafeMemoryCopyGuard`.
+
+Core logic:
+
+```csharp
+return destination != null &&
+       source != null &&
+       sourceSizeBytes >= 0L &&
+       destinationSizeBytes >= 0L &&
+       sourceSizeBytes <= destinationSizeBytes;
